      ],
      "text": "HOW THE AGENT WORKS Four brains. One careful loop. ✳ Each agent has a narrow job. A supervisor checks the hand-offs. You choose what deserves your time. 01 · DISCOVERY SCOUT Source scout Checks company career pages and permitted job sources for role records and application links. Career sites Job boards Posts ⟶ 02 · FIT ANALYST Match analyst Compares title, experience, skills, location and pay evidence with each candidate’s profile. Experience fit Skill fit Salary range ⟶ 03 · CONTEXT CONNECTOR Context finder Pairs a role with the referral or HR/TA details already supplied in your tracker. War",
